ORIGIN
------

The schematic, PCB layout, and the symbols and footprints in lib/ are
original work. The footprints follow the manufacturers' published drawings
(Littelfuse 59170, MYOUNG BH-123A-A1CJ002, Good Display GDEY0213B74 and
Hirose FH34SRJ-24S-0.5SH) and the MSP430FR2111 pinout follows TI datasheet
SLASE78; they contain no third-party design files.
